<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3" title="In Appendix A Implementation details ‣ Blockwise Flow Matching: Improving Flow Matching Models For Efficient High-Quality Generation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Inference complexity.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4" title="In Appendix A Implementation details ‣ Blockwise Flow Matching: Improving Flow Matching Models For Efficient High-Quality Generation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Metrics.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
